			title: "Saturn's Interior"
			x: 17.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5934DC53BB683C7F"]
			description: ["The next tank is built round aerogel, which is made from the archaeal culture at the aerogel works, so keep that line running. It unlocks Uranus and the ice-giant trips. Bring plenty of fuel: nothing out there refuels you. Build tanks in the assembler and let ME stock a few for every launch."]
			icon: "grindless:aerogel_fuel_tank"
			id: "3F7C9D7577EC9E61"
			rewards: [{ id: "188FE67046DD0268", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
