		{
			dependencies: ["5B2519B70D6E0738"]
			description: ["The Mk3, a fifth station and the first interstellar probe all wait for UV. ZPM only leaves you the flyby data, the chart and a lot of americium."]
			icon: "gtceu:uv_machine_hull"
