		{
			dependencies: ["5B2519B70D6E0738", "3B3A8E96594DFFE2"]
			description: ["Tritanium and darmstadtium make the &6UV Machine Hull&r, and the UV energy hatch needs everything you learned out here. Bring the Pluto chart and the Solar Core Survey along."]
