		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1D98852F1AB675C2"]
			description: ["The &6ZPM Circuit Assembler&r is the first assembler that can build the circuits ZPM machines are made of. ZPM components for its hull, a cleanroom you already run, and the circuits that feed it: the Crystal Processor Computer from the quest before, the Crystal Processor Mainframe from the LuV assembly line, or a UV universal circuit. The Wetware Processor Assembly, which only this assembler builds, and the circuits the controllers of this era ask for. Boards and chips arrive by ME from the cleanroom; keep a stock of what it returns."]
			icon: "gtceu:zpm_circuit_assembler"
			id: "77DE04F713EEBE61"
			rewards: [{ id: "5FC15E60BB7CE99E", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
