			title: "Crystal Computer"
			x: 3.5d
			y: -10.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7A980F3B74DBF079"]
			description: ["A &6Qubit CPU Wafer&r is a wafer treated with radon so that its structure can hold a quantum state. A nano CPU wafer and indium gallium phosphide dust, with a little radon, in a chemical reactor. A quantum eye with gallium arsenide is the other route. The qubit CPU chip, and through it the quantum processors the mainframe is built from. Every wafer uses its radon up. Pipe it from the plant continuously and keep a spare tank."]
			icon: "gtceu:qbit_cpu_wafer"
			id: "1000B35476B6FAC2"
			rewards: [{ id: "1B15AB89BB048686", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
