			x: 8.0d
			y: -7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5E3D46F05A5DC030"]
			description: [
				"One qubit array does the work of four circuits in an &6HPCA Computation Component&r, and two replace the advanced component's four UV circuits. Fewer parts, harder to make."
