		}
		{
			dependencies: ["53764AAB65F5DEA2"]
			description: ["Saturn orbit gets its own &6AE2 pair&r, so what the station makes goes home and what it needs comes out. Power doesn't need it: the wireless network already carries that."]
			icon: "grindless:station_truss_casing"
